<title>USA: Trade estimates for USDA grain export inspections.</title>
<headline>Trade estimates for USDA grain export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade estimates for the weekly U.S. grain and soybean export inspections due from the U.S. Department of Agriculture Monday at 1045 CDT are as follows, in millions of bushels.</p>
<p>		     Range	    week ago</p>
<p> Soybeans     12.0 to 15.0	12,070</p>
<p> All wheat    12.0 to 16.0	17,863</p>
<p> Corn	   32.0 to 35.0	34,588</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
